  "body": "* rpc: added PQC support [[PR#745](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/745), [PR#781](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/781)]\r\n* rpc: added support for more mechanisms [[PR#790](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/790)]\r\n* rpc: list-objects should no longer print garbage when used via RPC [[PR#782](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/782)]\r\n* rpc: memory management fixes and hardening [[PR#794](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/794), [PR#796](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/796), [PR#797](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/797), [PR#799](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/799)]\r\n* p11-kit: import-object now rejects malformed RSA public keys [[PR#795](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/795)]\r\n* trust: do not truncate DirectoryStrings with embeded NULL byte  [[PR#793](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/793)]\r\n* Build fixes [[PR#788](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/788), [PR#789](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/789)]\r\n* Update translations [[PR#783](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/783), [PR#784](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/784), [PR#787](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/787)]\r\n* Documentation [[PR#780](https://github.com/p11-glue/p11-kit/pull/780)]"
